<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
<head><meta charset="UTF-8"><title>Permissões atualizadas — ToolboxWaze</title></head>
<body style="margin:0;padding:0;background:#f4f4f4;font-family:'Helvetica Neue',Arial,sans-serif">
<table width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="background:#f4f4f4;padding:32px 16px">
  <tr><td align="center">
    <table width="520" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="background:#ffffff;border-radius:12px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 4px 24px rgba(0,0,0,.08);max-width:520px;width:100%">

      {# Cabeçalho azul-escuro #}
      <tr><td style="background:#005f99;padding:28px 32px">
        <p style="margin:0;color:#fff;font-size:1.3rem;font-weight:700">&#128274; Suas Permissões Foram Atualizadas</p>
        <p style="margin:6px 0 0;color:rgba(255,255,255,.75);font-size:.85rem">ToolboxWaze &mdash; Sistema de Gestão Waze</p>
      </td></tr>

      {# Corpo #}
      <tr><td style="padding:32px">
        <p style="margin:0 0 16px;color:#28251d;font-size:1rem">Olá, <strong>{{ user.name }}</strong>!</p>
        <p style="margin:0 0 24px;color:#5a5957;font-size:.95rem;line-height:1.6">
          Um administrador atualizou suas permissões de acesso no <strong>ToolboxWaze</strong>.
          Veja abaixo o que foi configurado:
        </p>

        {# Novas permissões #}
        <table width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="background:#f7f6f2;border-radius:8px;padding:16px;margin-bottom:28px">
          <tr>
            <td style="padding:6px 0;color:#7a7974;font-size:.82rem;width:130px">Usuário</td>
            <td style="padding:6px 0;color:#28251d;font-weight:600;font-size:.9rem">{{ user.name }}</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td style="padding:6px 0;color:#7a7974;font-size:.82rem">E-mail</td>
            <td style="padding:6px 0;color:#28251d;font-size:.9rem">{{ user.email }}</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td style="padding:6px 0;color:#7a7974;font-size:.82rem;vertical-align:top">Estados liberados</td>
            <td style="padding:6px 0">
              {% if allowedUfs is null %}
                <span style="display:inline-block;background:#cedcd8;color:#01696f;border-radius:4px;padding:2px 10px;font-size:.82rem;font-weight:700">&#127758; Todos os estados</span>
              {% elseif allowedUfs|length > 0 %}
                {% for uf in allowedUfs %}<span style="display:inline-block;background:#cedcd8;color:#01696f;border-radius:4px;padding:2px 7px;font-size:.75rem;font-weight:700;margin:2px 3px 2px 0">{{ uf }}</span>{% endfor %}
              {% else %}
                <span style="color:#e74c3c;font-size:.85rem">Nenhum estado configurado &mdash; contate o administrador.</span>
              {% endif %}
            </td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td style="padding:6px 0;color:#7a7974;font-size:.82rem;vertical-align:top">Perfil</td>
            <td style="padding:6px 0">
              {% if 'ROLE_ADMIN' in user.roles %}
                <span style="display:inline-block;background:#fde8c8;color:#964219;border-radius:4px;padding:2px 8px;font-size:.78rem;font-weight:700;margin:2px 3px 2px 0">Administrador</span>
              {% endif %}
              {% if 'ROLE_CHAMP' in user.roles %}
                <span style="display:inline-block;background:#e8d5f5;color:#6b21a8;border-radius:4px;padding:2px 8px;font-size:.78rem;font-weight:700;margin:2px 3px 2px 0">Champ</span>
              {% endif %}
              {% if 'ROLE_USER' in user.roles and 'ROLE_ADMIN' not in user.roles and 'ROLE_CHAMP' not in user.roles %}
                <span style="display:inline-block;background:#e0f2f1;color:#00695c;border-radius:4px;padding:2px 8px;font-size:.78rem;font-weight:700">Usuário padrão</span>
              {% endif %}
            </td>
          </tr>
        </table>

        <p style="margin:0 0 16px;color:#5a5957;font-size:.9rem">Faça login para começar a usar o sistema com as novas permissões:</p>
        <a href="{{ loginUrl }}" style="display:inline-block;background:#005f99;color:#ffffff;text-decoration:none;padding:12px 28px;border-radius:8px;font-weight:700;font-size:.95rem">Entrar no ToolboxWaze &rarr;</a>

        <p style="margin:28px 0 0;color:#bab9b4;font-size:.78rem">Se tiver dúvidas sobre suas permissões, entre em contato com o administrador.</p>
      </td></tr>

      {# Rodapé #}
      <tr><td style="background:#f7f6f2;border-top:1px solid #e8e6e1;padding:16px 32px;font-size:.78rem;color:#aaa;text-align:center">
        ToolboxWaze &mdash; sistema interno de gestão Waze
      </td></tr>

    </table>
  </td></tr>
</table>
</body>
</html>
